cowsay-dotnet is a .NET reimplementation of the classic cowsay program,
originally created by Tony Monroe (https://github.com/tnalpgge/rank-amateur-cowsay)
and maintained by the cowsay-org project led by Andrew Janke
(https://github.com/cowsay-org/cowsay).

