or (at your option) any later version.

Additionally, many of the cow art files (.cow files) included in this
distribution originate from the original cowsay project and are licensed
under a broader dual-licensing grant of GNU GPL 1 or later and the
Artistic License 1.0, following the licensing established by Tony Monroe
and preserved by the cowsay-org project. The exact licensing situation of
individual cow files is inherited from the upstream projects. You may use
the entirety of the cowsay-dotnet distribution under "GNU GPL 3 or later"
terms. If you want to use the GNU GPL 1, GNU GPL 2, or Artistic License
terms for specific cow files, you may need to research which files are
licensed under those terms in the upstream projects.

